        "id": 2903
      },
      "writtenOn": "2013-07-28T23:01:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does this need to invalidate tokens?  In cases where we update user information we need to invalidate tokens.  It seems like an update might warrant this.\n\nBut I am not 100% sure.",
      "revId": "3c663ff6a8413fd8f84a2cbd908d92138165be5b",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
